T*
(6. Liquidity Requirements) Tj
T*
(6.1 Liquidity Coverage Ratio \(LCR\)) Tj
T*
(Authorized institutions must maintain a Liquidity Coverage Ratio of at least 100%. The) Tj
T*
(LCR ensures that banks have sufficient high-quality liquid assets to withstand a 30-day) Tj
T*
(stress scenario.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6.2 Net Stable Funding Ratio \(NSFR\)) Tj
T*
(Banks must maintain a Net Stable Funding Ratio of at least 100%. The NSFR promotes) Tj
T*
(resilience over a longer time horizon by requiring stable funding relative to the) Tj
T*
(liquidity profile of assets.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(7. Stress Testing Requirements) Tj
T*
(7.1 Annual Stress Tests) Tj
T*
(All authorized institutions must conduct annual stress tests covering credit risk,) Tj
T*
(market risk, and liquidity risk. The stress tests must be approved by the board of) Tj
T*
(directors.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(7.2 Scenarios) Tj
T*
(Stress test scenarios must include severe but plausible adverse economic conditions,) Tj
T*
(including economic downturns, market shocks, and liquidity pressures.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(8. Reporting Requirements) Tj
T*
(8.1 Monthly Returns) Tj
T*
(Banks must submit monthly returns to the HKMA covering capital adequacy ratios, leverage) Tj
T*
(ratios, and liquidity positions.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(8.2 Disclosure Requirements) Tj
T*
(Authorized institutions must publicly disclose their capital adequacy ratios, leverage) Tj
T*
(ratios, and liquidity coverage ratios on a quarterly basis.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(9. Regulatory Capital Instruments) Tj
T*
(9.1 CET1 Capital) Tj
T*
(Common Equity Tier 1 capital includes common shares, retained earnings, and other) Tj
T*
(comprehensive income.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(9.2 Additional Tier 1 Capital) Tj
T*
(Additional Tier 1 capital instruments include perpetual non-cumulative preference shares) Tj
T*
(and other instruments that meet specific criteria.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(9.3 Tier 2 Capital) Tj
T*
(Tier 2 capital includes subordinated debt, loan loss reserves, and other instruments) Tj
T*
(that provide loss absorption on a gone-concern basis.) Tj
T*
() Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
